### 4. Reject KYC (with reason)
### Rejects a user's KYC profile, setting its status to 'REJECTED' and storing the reason.
### An audit log entry is created for this action.
###
### Parameters:
###   - userId: uuid of the user whose KYC profile is to be rejected.
###
### Body:
###   - reason: String (e.g., "Document image unclear", "Information mismatch")
###
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/kyc/user-uuid-1/reject
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "reason": "Document image unclear, please provide a clearer scan."
}

